OL,3,GNEWSAOne arrested and three injured
OL,4,Aafter police chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after three
OL,7,Fpeople were injured when a car crashed
OL,8,Finto a wall when it was being pursued
OL,9,Fby police.
OL,11,FPolice attempted to stop the Volkswagen
OL,12,FPassat at 20:39 GMT on Monday on
OL,13,FHuddersfield Road, Bradford but it
OL,14,Ffailed to stop and crashed into a wall
OL,15,Fafter a short pursuit, the West
OL,16,FYorkshire force said.
OL,18,FA 26-year-old man was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of theft of a motor vehicle,
OL,20,Ffailing to stop and dangerous driving
OL,21,Fand remains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
