OL,3,GNEWSAOne arrested and three injured
OL,4,Aafter police chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people in the vehicle were taken
OL,7,Fto hospital. Two men suffered serious
OL,8,Fbut not life-threatening injuries. The
OL,9,Farrested driver was also taken to
OL,10,Fhospital but later discharged.
